        "treatment_summary": {
          "value": "Ex vivo αβTCR/CD19-depleted allo-HSCT at age 23 from a 9/10 matched unrelated donor (MUD 9/10) after myeloablative conditioning (ATG-Fresenius, fludarabine, thiotepa, melphalan); immune therapy at SCT: prednisolone + ruxolitinib + anakinra; after SCT: MMF + prednisolone + ruxolitinib + anakinra, with disease-associated immunosuppression tapered only after MMF was stopped at day 28; letermovir prophylaxis until day 100 post allo-SCT.",
          "span": [
            "| 9 | F | 23 | IEI HA20 | Pos/ Pos | Pos/ Pos | MUD 9/10 | Prednisolone + Ruxolitinib + Anakinra",
            "| 9 | IEI HA20 | 11 | MMF + Prednisolone + Ruxolitinib + Anakinra",
            "Myeloablative conditioning consisted of anti-thymocyte globulin (ATG)-Fresenius, fludarabine, thiotepa and melphalan",
            "we started tapering the disease-associated immunosuppression only after the MMF could successfully be stopped at day 28 in patient #7, #9 and #10",
